		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I am shocked to hear that Hayra has gone &#8211; I didn&#8217;t know.<br />
She and I worked on a correspondence course together. It was a way of encouraging people in isolated areas to read the message volumes. We had a very simplistic approach bu we received some quite positive feedback! She had a great deal of enthusiasm&#8230;.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
