	<item>
		<title>By: mariel</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=515&#038;cpage=1#comment-4432</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[mariel]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 25 Apr 2010 19:16:44 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=515#comment-4432</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I think of Hayra very often even after many years since her passing.  She was always smiling and had great optimism even dealing with health issues.  I loved her enthusiasm and humor.  For me, she may be gone from the body but surely not forgotten.  I honor the great soul she is.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I think of Hayra very often even after many years since her passing.  She was always smiling and had great optimism even dealing with health issues.  I loved her enthusiasm and humor.  For me, she may be gone from the body but surely not forgotten.  I honor the great soul she is.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
	<item>
		<title>By: Hafizullah</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=515&#038;cpage=1#comment-3715</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Hafizullah]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 07 Feb 2010 02:48:37 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=515#comment-3715</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I was always struck and often astonished at Hayra&#039;s gritty engagement with the difficult side of the spiritual path and the encounter with the scruffy and &quot;un-elevated&quot; within herself and all of us. She modeled a courage and trust-in-the-process that I admired and loved. She is sorely missed.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I was always struck and often astonished at Hayra&#8217;s gritty engagement with the difficult side of the spiritual path and the encounter with the scruffy and &#8220;un-elevated&#8221; within herself and all of us. She modeled a courage and trust-in-the-process that I admired and loved. She is sorely missed.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
